OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of light
OL,6,Frain at first. Windy near coasts. Low
OL,7,Fcloud and heavy rain moving northeast
OL,8,Fthrough the morning and afternoon,
OL,9,Faccompanied by strengthening winds and
OL,10,Fgales possible along the coast later.
OL,11,FMaximum Temperature 12C.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FWinds gradually easing
OL,14,Fthrough the evening, as rain becomes
OL,15,Fpatchy before eventually clearing
OL,16,Ftoward midnight. Becoming dry with
OL,17,Fclear spells through the early hours,
OL,18,Fbut remaining breezy. Minimum
OL,19,FTemperature 5C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
