OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA dry, chilly and breezy start
OL,6,Fto the day. Long sunny spells
OL,7,Fthroughout, feeling less cold as winds
OL,8,Fease later. Maximum Temperature 9C.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,11,Fand breezy Saturday, with sunny
OL,12,Fspells, turning cloudy later in the
OL,13,Fwest. Cloudy Sunday, with outbreaks of
OL,14,Frain, perhaps heavy. Drier but cloudy
OL,15,FMonday. Temperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
